<tr>
  <td style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center;">
    <h1 style="margin: 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.5px;">
      Welcome to AppSciArt! 🎉
    </h1>
  </td>
</tr>

<tr>
  <td style="padding: 40px 30px;">
    <p style="margin: 0 0 20px; color: #2d3748; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
      Hi there,
    </p>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 30px; color: #2d3748; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
      Congratulations on your successful pre-registration! We're excited to have you join our community. You're just one click away from unlocking all the amazing features AppSciArt has to offer.
    </p>

    <table role="presentation" style="margin: 0 auto;">
      <tr>
        <td style="text-align: center;">
          <a href="<%= completeRegistrationUrl %>" 
              style="display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 16px 40px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.4); transition: transform 0.2s;">
            Complete Registration →
          </a>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    
    <p style="margin: 30px 0 0; color: #718096; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
      If you didn't create an account with us, you can safely ignore this email.
    </p>
  </td>
</tr>
